        <li><a href="#jinshanling" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">☁️ Jinshanling</a></li>
        <li><a href="#simatai" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌃 Simatai</a></li>
        <li><a href="#huanghuacheng" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💧 Huanghuacheng</a></li>
        <li><a href="#juyongguan" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏯 Juyongguan</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tickets" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎫 Tickets &amp; Booking</a></li>
        <li><a href="#best-time" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📅 Best Time to Go</a></li>
        <li><a href="#practical-tips" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👟 What Should You Pack?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#history" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📜 Ming Bricks, Not Qin</a></li>
